    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>Weight steady; no fever or fatigue</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No change in vision with reading glasses</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No hearing loss or dental pain</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, palpitations, or ankle swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough; marble dust controlled with a mask and extraction fan</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No indigestion, dark stools, or bleeding</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Nocturia once; no flank pain, blood in the urine, or passed stones</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild left thumb-base ache after long carving sessions; no gout flare</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Finger wound healed; no new skin lesions</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No dizziness, imbalance, or memory change</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood steady; PHQ-2 score 0</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>11 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

