    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 20 minutes, with his consent. He has named a health care agent and signed a written directive; a copy is in the chart. He wants treatment for reversible illness, including hospital care. If he could no longer work or recognize the people around him, he would want comfort-focused care at home rather than resuscitation or a breathing machine. He asked that his wishes about his studio and his unfinished work be recorded with his own papers rather than in the medical record. [S]</paragraph></text>

